Here is a complete HTML file that recreates a pixel-perfect Space Invaders game, a single HTML file with embedded CSS and JavaScript.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders (1978) – Pixel Perfect</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background: #000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .cabinet-wrapper {
      background: #111;
      border: 2px solid #000;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px 20px 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 0 10px #000;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .canvas-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      background: #000;
      border: 4px solid #222;
      border-radius: 4px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 2px #0f0, 0 0 0 1px #333;
      line-height: 0;
    }

    canvas {
      display: block;
      width: 800px;
      height: 800px;
      background: #000;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
    }

    .controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: #f0f0;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0 10px;
    }

    .controls span {
      background: #000;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      border-radius: 2px;
      color: #0f0;
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px #0f0;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .controls .score {
      color: #fff;
      background: #000;
      border: 1px solid #0f0;
    }

    .info {
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
      padding-top: 6px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .info a {
      color: #0f0;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* 1978 pixel art style */
    .sprite {
      display: inline-block;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="cabinet-wrapper">
    <div class="canvas-wrapper">
      <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="800" height="800"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
      <span>🔴 <span style="color:#0f0;">⬇</span>  </span>
      <span class="score" id="scoreDisplay">000</span>
      <span>⬅ ⬇ ➡</span>
    </div>
    <div class="info">
      <span>⏺ 1978 TAI · COSMIC ·  </span> <span style="color:#0f0;"> SPACE INVADERS</span>
    </div>
  </div>

